    <Program class="ca.nrcan.gc.OEE.ERS.ErsProgram">
        <Labels>
            <English>EnerGuide Rating System</English>
            <French>Système de cote ÉnerGuide</French>
        </Labels>
        <Version major="15" minor="6" build="18345">
            <Labels>
                <English>v15.6b18345</English>
                <French>v15.6b18345</French>
            </Labels>
        </Version>
        <SdkVersion major="1" minor="16" build="18345">
            <Labels>
                <English>v1.16b18345</English>
                <French>v1.16b18345</French>
            </Labels>
        </SdkVersion>
        <Options>
            <Main applyHouseholdOperatingConditions="false" applyReducedOperatingConditions="false" atypicalElectricalLoads="false" waterConservation="false" referenceHouse="false">
                <Vermiculite code="1">
                    <English>Unknown</English>
                    <French>Inconnu</French>
                </Vermiculite>
            </Main>
            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>Air Leakage Areas:



Back wall along floor trim in addition.



Range hood fan penetration



Under and around front bathtub



Front Bathroom fan is not working properly, damper may need to be replaced.



Front Bedroom cutout area/exposed floor. Along bottom trim.



Door sweeps need to be replaced and weather stripping around doors.



Along the air supply and exhaust pipes/ducting for the furnace is quite leaky.</airSeal>
                <windows>Upgrade windows to ENERGY STAR® Zone 3 rated.



Please refer to Artic Energy Alliance for rebates on windows/doors and the criteria for these products.</windows>
                <VentilationSystem>Install a digital control for the humidistat.</VentilationSystem>
                <HotWaterSystem>Replace conventional gas water heater with a ENERGY STAR®  rated instantaneous on-demand hot water heater with an Energy Factor (EF) of 0.92 or greater.



Please refer to Artic Energy Alliance for rebates on DHW systems and the criteria for these products.</HotWaterSystem>
                <HeatingSystem>Install a digital or smart thermostat to help reduce gas consumption.



Upgrade furnace to an ENERGY STAR® condensing gas furnace with a 95% AFUE. Must have an ECM energy efficient motor on it as well.



Please refer to Artic Energy Alliance for rebates on heating systems and the criteria for these products.</HeatingSystem>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
